---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog
description: Notes from Lunabit Labs, an independent app studio in Bahrain.
---
<section class="section" style="padding-top: 56px;">
  <div class="narrow">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">lunabit.labs</p>
      <h2 style="font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1;">blog</h2>
      <p>Notes on the apps and how they're made. <a href="/blog/feed.xml">Subscribe with a feed reader</a>.</p>
    </div>
    {%- if collections.posts.length %}
    <ul class="post-list">
      {%- for post in collections.posts %}
      <li><a href="{{ post.url }}"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time><h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>{% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}</a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- else %}
    <p>Nothing here yet.</p>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>
